 R←Test_Table_012(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;Tbl;cells;markdown;newCursorCol
⍝ `FormatTable` copes with a footer, with missing column headers and with sloppy input
⍝ R gets one of: 0=Okay, 1=test case failed, ¯1=test case was not executed due to the "batchFlag"
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 Tbl←##.Meddy.Tables

 ⍝ A footer row
 (cells markdown newCursorCol)←Tbl.FormatTable('| A | B |' '|---|---|' '| 1 | 2 |' '|===|===|')0 2
 →T.PassesIf('|A|B|' '|-|-|' '|1|2|' '|=|=|')≡markdown

 ⍝ A column devider but no column headers
 (cells markdown newCursorCol)←Tbl.FormatTable('|---|---|' '| a | 1 |' '| bb | 22 |')0 2
 →T.PassesIf('|--|--|' '|a | 1|' '|bb|22|')≡markdown

 ⍝ Leading and trailing pipes missing
 (cells markdown newCursorCol)←Tbl.FormatTable('| A | B ' '|---|---' '| 1 | 2 ')0 2
 →T.PassesIf('|A|B|' '|-|-|' '|1|2|')≡markdown

 ⍝ An escaped pipe and a pipe inside code must not be taken for a cell devider
 (cells markdown newCursorCol)←Tbl.FormatTable('| A | B |' '|---|---|' '| a\|b | 2 |')0 2
 →T.PassesIf('|A   |B|' '|----|-|' '|a\|b|2|')≡markdown
 (cells markdown newCursorCol)←Tbl.FormatTable('| A | B |' '|---|---|' '| `x|y` | 2 |')0 2
 →T.PassesIf('|A    |B|' '|-----|-|' '|`x|y`|2|')≡markdown

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
